        <p class="intro">Choose every answer that applies for each question, then submit your selections.</p>

        <form id="quiz-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-field">
            <fieldset aria-describedby="question-1-help">
              <legend>1. Which of these are programming languages?</legend>
              <p class="help-text" id="question-1-help">Select all choices that are used to write executable computer programs.</p>
